{
  "name": "flux-reference",
  "description": "A reference inference implementation for the FLUX.1 family of latent flow matching models, supporting high-fidelity text-to-image synthesis, structural conditioning, and advanced image editing. The codebase integrates optimized TensorRT engines for high-performance execution alongside standard PyTorch paths, covering specialized tasks such as inpainting, depth/canny conditioning, and image variation. It provides a modular framework for transformer-based diffusion, including components for T5/CLIP text embedding, VAE autoencoding, and flexible sampling schedules.",
